  "original_message": "feat: Map browser sorting, filters, downloads, and map editing\n\nMapDB 2.0 map gallery backend features from the \"New Map Database & Browser\"\nproject:\n\n- Count downloads. `CncMap.download_count` (all time) plus per-day\n  `CncMapDownloadStat` rows, incremented with F() expressions so concurrent\n  downloads are all counted. No downloader data is stored.\n- `GET /maps/<id>/download/` (optionally `?version=N`) for the new UI and\n  client integration. The MapDB 1.0 route `/<game>/<sha1>.zip` now counts\n  downloads too, and returns 404 for banned maps.\n- `/maps/search/` sorting: `popular`, `trending` (downloads within\n  MAP_TRENDING_WINDOW_DAYS, default 7), `newest` (new default), `updated`\n  (newest file version), plus name/size fields. Fixes a 500 when ordering by\n  the old `cnc_map_file__*` fields, which don't exist on CncMap.\n- `/maps/search/` filters: `author`, `cnc_user_id`, `category_slug`,\n  `min/max_width`, `min/max_height` (newest file version), and\n  `created_after/before`.\n- `PATCH /maps/<id>/` works now (it raised NotImplementedError). Authors can\n  edit name, description, categories, published and incomplete_upload; staff\n  can also curate with `is_reviewed`. Staff edits of other users' maps are\n  recorded in moderated_by / moderator_notes.\n- `manage.py purge_temporary_maps --days N [--dry-run]` removes old,\n  unused, anonymous lobby uploads and their files. Keeps banned maps and\n  maps that other maps credit as their parent.\n- Docs in docs/map_browser.md.\n"
}
